{"schema_version": 1, "tool": "search_knowledge", "tool_call_id": "call_00_LxR4Ag8p8x8Hy2rFX9Jb8318", "corpus_hash": "5863212f2b2165ea6237b6a33d04f736d827ec23201925879cb106faf8c533c8", "status": "ok", "data": {"hits": [{"evidence_id": "d98fd8297fd0457ea697003cbd9d5894:E1", "doc_id": "D01", "title": "差旅报销规定 D01", "version_date": "2026-01-01", "content_hash": "e2224c4c7e19f1ec6fa0fb2d37800a4adfc77c170baed7c44625f5a5e84279b4", "section_id": "D01-S0001", "section_heading": "国内差旅报销规定", "heading_span": {"start": 2, "end": 10}, "chunk_id": "D01-C0001", "source_span": {"start": 0, "end": 12}, "text": "# 国内差旅报销规定\n\n"}, {"evidence_id": "d98fd8297fd0457ea697003cbd9d5894:E2", "doc_id": "D01", "title": "差旅报销规定 D01", "version_date": "2026-01-01", "content_hash": "e2224c4c7e19f1ec6fa0fb2d37800a4adfc77c170baed7c44625f5a5e84279b4", "section_id": "D01-S0002", "section_heading": "一、用途与适用事项", "heading_span": {"start": 15, "end": 24}, "chunk_id": "D01-C0002", "source_span": {"start": 12, "end": 59}, "text": "## 一、用途与适用事项\n\n本规定说明员工国内差旅报销的提交期限，以及报销申请的处理状态。\n\n"}, {"evidence_id": "d98fd8297fd0457ea697003cbd9d5894:E3", "doc_id": "D01", "title": "差旅报销规定 D01", "version_date": "2026-01-01", "content_hash": "e2224c4c7e19f1ec6fa0fb2d37800a4adfc77c170baed7c44625f5a5e84279b4", "section_id": "D01-S0003", "section_heading": "二、提交期限", "heading_span": {"start": 62, "end": 68}, "chunk_id": "D01-C0003", "source_span": {"start": 59, "end": 122}, "text": "## 二、提交期限\n\n1. 国内差旅报销须在行程结束后 30 天内提交。\n2. 报销申请的处理状态与上述提交期限分别记录。\n\n"}, {"evidence_id": "d98fd8297fd0457ea697003cbd9d5894:E4", "doc_id": "D01", "title": "差旅报销规定 D01", "version_date": "2026-01-01", "content_hash": "e2224c4c7e19f1ec6fa0fb2d37800a4adfc77c170baed7c44625f5a5e84279b4", "section_id": "D01-S0004", "section_heading": "三、申请状态说明", "heading_span": {"start": 125, "end": 133}, "chunk_id": "D01-C0004", "source_span": {"start": 122, "end": 221}, "text": "## 三、申请状态说明\n\n1. “已提交”表示申请已进入处理队列，不代表审核通过。\n2. “处理中”表示申请仍在审核，不能据此认定已完成付款。\n3. 员工查询处理进度时，应区分申请状态与付款状态。\n"}], "segments": [], "locators": []}, "errors": [], "execution": {"strategy": "hybrid", "requested_mode": "hybrid", "effective_branches": ["bm25", "vector"], "next_cursor": null, "has_more": false, "return_limited": false}}
